    "done_when": "Per §71 of the plan: the follower prints no row for a replayed baseline whose to_state equals the state the pane last showed for that run; a baseline naming a different state, every real transition, and the first row of a run the pane has not shown still print. tests/test_a_reload_replay_prints_no_self_transition.py feeds a follower a run's waiting transition, a reload's replayed new to waiting baseline, then a real waiting to working, and finds exactly two rows for the run; a second case replays a baseline naming a different state and finds it printed. Every test file under tests/ importing reckon.crew_follow_commands or reckon.crew.follower_reload, or driving crew follow, rebuilt from the head tree, adds no failure against a base arm, both arms from git checkouts under the run's own scratch directory with RECKON_SESSION_HOST_SETTLE, RECKON_FOLLOWER_OWNER, RECKON_FOLLOWER_IMAGE_COMMIT and RECKON_FOLLOWER_SOURCE_ROOT unset, run in place on the fleet node with pytest -n 8; any id failing in one arm only is run five times alone in each arm. tests/test_every_module_fits_a_worker_window.py passes at head. Every log is under the run directory, starts with its revision and the literal command, and ends in EXIT=. ruff check and ruff format --check add no findings on the changed files, judged against the base blobs.",
